What made you think Excalibur or reflection would work? Neither grants
magic resistance. Reflection reflects certain attacks back where they
came from, not including strength drain or Destroy Armor. I may
remember this wrong, but I don't think it'll reflect an attack unless
you can see that attack strike you as a line in the ASCII display
connecting your @ with the source. (Or coming from the dark if you
can't see the source of the attack.) You can get MR from many sources,
such as the aptly named cloak of magic resistance (CoMR).

